@startuml
title Healthcare Portal - User Registration and Login State Machine Diagram

state PortalChoice1 <<choice>>
state PortalChoice2 <<choice>>
state PortalChoice3 <<choice>>
state ServiceJoin <<choice>>
state OwnerJoin <<choice>>
state RegistrationFailed <<choice>>
state SignInFailed <<choice>>
state LoggedInUser <<choice>>
state HealthInfo <<choice>>
state Payment <<choice>>
state Feedback <<choice>>
state Logout <<choice>>

[*] --> PortalChoice1

PortalChoice1 --> PortalChoice2 : [Healthcare Portal]
PortalChoice1 --> PortalChoice3 : [New User Registration]

PortalChoice2 --> ServiceCenterRegistration : [Service Center Registration]
PortalChoice2 --> ServiceJoin : [Registered Service center]
PortalChoice3 --> CarOwnerRegistration : [New Car Owner Registration]
PortalChoice3 --> OwnerJoin : [Registered Car Owner]

state "Service Center Registration" as ServiceCenterRegistration
ServiceCenterRegistration : entry / Unregistered service center
ServiceCenterRegistration : do / Enter Valid Credentials
ServiceCenterRegistration : exit / Account registered or RegistrationFailed

state "Service Center Verification" as ServiceCenterVerification
ServiceCenterVerification : entry / Service Center account registered
ServiceCenterVerification : do / Verify Service center
ServiceCenterVerification : exit / Login Service center or RegistrationFailed

state "Service Center Login" as ServiceCenterLogin
ServiceCenterLogin : entry / Verified Service Center
ServiceCenterLogin : entry / Service Center not logged in
ServiceCenterLogin : do / Authenticate Service Center
ServiceCenterLogin : exit / Logged In Successfully or SignInFailed

state "Service center Home" as ServiceCenterHome
ServiceCenterHome : entry / Logged in Service Center
ServiceCenterHome : do / Display home page
ServiceCenterHome : exit / Enter Damaged parts list or HealthInfo or Payment or Feedback or Logout

state "Entering Damaged parts list" as DamagedParts
DamagedParts : entry / To enter Damaged parts list
DamagedParts : do / Preparing and entering damaged parts list
DamagedParts : exit / Return to Service center home page

state "Updating parts Information" as UpdatingParts
UpdatingParts : entry / To update changed parts information
UpdatingParts : do / Update Information
UpdatingParts : exit / Return to Service center home page

state "Logout" as Logout
Logout : entry / To Logout
Logout : do / Logout
Logout : exit / Logged out Successfully

ServiceCenterRegistration --> RegistrationFailed : [Invalid Credentials]
ServiceCenterVerification --> RegistrationFailed : [Invalid Service Center]
ServiceCenterLogin --> SignInFailed : [Invalid Credentials]
ServiceCenterHome --> HealthInfo : [View News and Expert Content]
ServiceCenterHome --> Payment : [Select Payment Method]
ServiceCenterHome --> Feedback : [Provide User Feedback]
LoggedInUser --> HealthInfo : [Read News and Expert Content]
LoggedInUser --> Payment : [Process and Validate Insurance for Available Finance-related Services]
LoggedInUser --> Feedback : [Collect User Feedback after Service Completion]
ServiceCenterHome --> Logout : [End Session or Continue Using the System]
@enduml
